# Changelog

- Read `CHANGELOG.md` before changing platform behavior.
- Update the active unreleased version in `CHANGELOG.md` in the same task as any
  user-visible or operational change. Group related changes and avoid duplicate
  entries, commit dumps, and empty categories.
- The already-pushed baseline is 1.0.0 at commit
  `d9f05890c8d99e910b70880aeb9ad7df526b728d`. Current work belongs to 1.0.1 until
  it is released. Follow the Maintenance section for subsequent versions.
- Record database migrations, configuration requirements, removals, and
  compatibility impacts when relevant. Never invent release dates, tags, or
  successful test results. Preserve released entries.
- Changelog-only edits do not need their own changelog entry.
